<title>USA: CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 12.</title>
<headline>CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soyoil for September 13 (In contracts).</p>
<p>SOYOIL - 2,016 lots. Oldest long - September 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - LFG/c 50, Combs/c 80, ING/c 177, 1st Option/c 170, kenosha/h 473, 1st option/c 316, 1st option/c 748, ADM Investor Services/c 2.</p>
<p>Stopped - Dorman/c 2, Combs/h 12, ING/c 58, 1st option/c 188, kenosha/h 751, 1st option/c 354, 1st option/c 564, ADM Investor Services/h 87.</p>
<p>H=House account, C=Customer account.</p>
